-- CanEquipUniqueItem at :2005.  A base item therefore counted against its
-- own replacement and every upgrade of a tagged item failed with
-- "You can only carry 1 <family>".  EQUIP mode skips that block; the
-- family is still enforced on equip, and there with except_slot honoured.
-- Retail agrees: Death's Choice / Death's Verdict and the other
-- one-trinket-two-entries families are all mode 1.
